    title: "Picnic",
    description: Some("Bugs swarm down onto a row of cheeseburgers, and a swatter slides along the ground to meet them. A swat only connects if it lands exactly as a bug extends its tongue, and the swatter springs back the instant it fires, so timing is everything. Knock a bug into the trap for double, or the Super Bug for a thousand."),
